#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2281-B expect=skipped domain=PC
#note "THE §4 GATE PIN (top-level-or board wave 2, group J): PCTPTREF is not present in the dataset; the pre-split bare empty() leaf flooded on every row here. This half carries Requirements.Variables.All [PCTPTREF] - an auditable SKIP naming the column, the Fix #331 bucket-2 disposition. If this EXECUTES, the gate has been removed - escalate, do not rewrite."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset PC class=FINDINGS label="Pharmacokinetics Concentrations"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col PCSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col PCNOMDY  type=Num  label="Nominal Study Day for Tabulations"
col PCELTM   type=Char label="Planned Elapsed Time from Time Point Ref"
---
S1 | PC | 001 | 1 | 1 | PT0H
